[00:13.48]1. Raise your eyes up and see,
[00:20.00]Far above the highest hill.
[00:24.38]There stands Jehovah’s mountain
[00:27.98]Lifted up in this day.
[00:34.60]People come from afar,
[00:37.90]Ev’rywhere from sea to sea,
[00:41.38]Calling to one another,
[00:46.04]‘Come serve God and obey.’
[00:49.94]Now the time has arrived
[00:54.42]For the small, a great nation to be.
[00:58.86]As we grow and we thrive,
[01:03.52]God’s direction and blessing we see.
[01:10.00]Millions now come to God
[01:13.96]And accept his sov’reignty.
[01:19.38]Loyal they vow to be
[01:22.18]And from his side never stray.
[01:30.56]2. Jesus gave the command
[01:31.04]To go forth and preach the word.
[01:31.06]Good news about the Kingdom
[01:31.06]Reaches all men today.
[01:31.06]Christ now rules from above,
[01:31.06]Urging all to take his side.
[01:56.54]Meek ones who hear his voice
[01:56.54]Let God’s Word show them the way.
[01:58.70]It brings joy to the heart,
[01:58.70]As the great crowd continues to grow.
[01:58.90]And we all have a part,
[01:58.90]As we strive to let ev’ryone know.
[02:01.56]Let us lift up the voice,
[02:01.56]Calling out for all to hear,
[02:05.62]‘Come to Jehovah’s mountain,
[02:06.82]Here forever to stay.’
